<p data-start=3D"3906" data-end=3D"4088" class=3D"">Dans cet exemple, le co=
nteneur utilise <code data-start=3D"3945" data-end=3D"3951">flex</code> pou=
r activer Flexbox, et les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments enfants sont distribu=C3=A9s h=
orizontalement avec des largeurs =C3=A9gales (1/3 de la largeur du conteneu=
r).</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"4090" data-end=3D"4136" class=3D"">2. <strong data-start=
=3D"4098" data-end=3D"4134">Direction des =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments flexibles</str=
ong> :</h4>
<p data-start=3D"4138" data-end=3D"4262" class=3D"">La direction des =C3=A9=
l=C3=A9ments dans un conteneur flex peut =C3=AAtre contr=C3=B4l=C3=A9e avec=
 les classes <code data-start=3D"4224" data-end=3D"4234">flex-row</code> (p=
ar d=C3=A9faut) et <code data-start=3D"4251" data-end=3D"4261">flex-col</co=
de>.</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4264" data-end=3D"4369">
<li data-start=3D"4264" data-end=3D"4317" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4266" data-end=3D"4317" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
266" data-end=3D"4278">flex-row</strong> : Aligne les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments ho=
rizontalement.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4318" data-end=3D"4369" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4320" data-end=3D"4369" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
320" data-end=3D"4332">flex-col</strong> : Aligne les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments ve=
rticalement.</p>
</li>
</ul>
