<p data-start=3D"5314" data-end=3D"5402" class=3D"">Ici, les =C3=A9l=C3=A9m=
ents vont s'enrouler sur plusieurs lignes lorsque l=E2=80=99espace est insu=
ffisant.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"5404" data-end=3D"5407" class=3D"">
<h3 data-start=3D"5409" data-end=3D"5456" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5413" data-end=3D"5456">5. Alignement des =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments avec Flexbox</=
strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"5458" data-end=3D"5653" class=3D"">Flexbox vous permet d'a=
ligner facilement les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments enfants =C3=A0 l=E2=80=99int=C3=A9=
rieur d'un conteneur flex. Tailwind propose plusieurs classes utilitaires p=
our manipuler l=E2=80=99alignement horizontal et vertical.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"5655" data-end=3D"5696" class=3D"">1. <strong data-start=
=3D"5663" data-end=3D"5696">Alignement horizontal (Axe X)</strong></h4>
<ul data-start=3D"5698" data-end=3D"5999">
<li data-start=3D"5698" data-end=3D"5775" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5700" data-end=3D"5775" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
700" data-end=3D"5717">justify-start</strong> : Aligne les =C3=A9l=C3=A9men=
ts au d=C3=A9but du conteneur (par d=C3=A9faut).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5776" data-end=3D"5829" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5778" data-end=3D"5829" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
778" data-end=3D"5796">justify-center</strong> : Aligne les =C3=A9l=C3=A9me=
nts au centre.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5830" data-end=3D"5879" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5832" data-end=3D"5879" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
832" data-end=3D"5847">justify-end</strong> : Aligne les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments=
 =C3=A0 la fin.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5880" data-end=3D"5939" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5882" data-end=3D"5939" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
882" data-end=3D"5901">justify-between</strong> : Espacement =C3=A9gal entr=
e les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5940" data-end=3D"5999" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5942" data-end=3D"5999" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
942" data-end=3D"5960">justify-around</strong> : Espacement =C3=A9gal autou=
r des =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments.</p>
</li>
</ul>
