<hr data-start=3D"6659" data-end=3D"6662" class=3D"">
<h3 data-start=3D"6664" data-end=3D"6727" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6668" data-end=3D"6727">6. Flexibilit=C3=A9 et distribution de l=E2=80=99es=
pace avec Flexbox</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"6729" data-end=3D"6816" class=3D"">Flexbox permet de contr=
=C3=B4ler la taille et la r=C3=A9partition des =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments dans un c=
onteneur.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"6818" data-end=3D"6905" class=3D"">1. <strong data-start=
=3D"6826" data-end=3D"6905">Propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s de flexibilit=C3=A9 des =
=C3=A9l=C3=A9ments (flex-grow, flex-shrink, flex-basis)</strong></h4>
<ul data-start=3D"6907" data-end=3D"7159">
<li data-start=3D"6907" data-end=3D"6995" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6909" data-end=3D"6995" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
909" data-end=3D"6922">flex-grow</strong> : Permet =C3=A0 un =C3=A9l=C3=A9m=
ent de se d=C3=A9velopper pour occuper l'espace disponible.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6996" data-end=3D"7065" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6998" data-end=3D"7065" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
998" data-end=3D"7013">flex-shrink</strong> : Permet =C3=A0 un =C3=A9l=C3=
=A9ment de se r=C3=A9tr=C3=A9cir si n=C3=A9cessaire.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7066" data-end=3D"7159" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7068" data-end=3D"7159" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
068" data-end=3D"7082">flex-basis</strong> : D=C3=A9finit la taille de base=
 de l'=C3=A9l=C3=A9ment avant que l'espace ne soit r=C3=A9parti.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"7161" data-end=3D"7293" class=3D"">Tailwind CSS vous perme=
t de contr=C3=B4ler ces propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s avec des classes utilitaires c=
omme <code data-start=3D"7249" data-end=3D"7260">flex-grow</code>, <code da=
ta-start=3D"7262" data-end=3D"7275">flex-shrink</code>, et <code data-start=
=3D"7280" data-end=3D"7292">flex-basis</code>.</p>
