<hr data-start=3D"5893" data-end=3D"5896" class=3D"">
<h3 data-start=3D"5898" data-end=3D"5957" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5902" data-end=3D"5957">5. Classes de couleur utilitaires dans Tailwind CSS=
</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"5959" data-end=3D"6173" class=3D"">Tailwind CSS vous perme=
t de d=C3=A9finir des couleurs non seulement pour les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments de=
 fond et les bordures, mais =C3=A9galement pour le texte, les ombres, et bi=
en plus. Voici un aper=C3=A7u des classes de couleur utilitaires :</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"6175" data-end=3D"6209" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6180" data-end=3D"6199">Couleur de fond</strong> (<code data-start=3D"6201"=
 data-end=3D"6207">bg-*</code>):</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"6210" data-end=3D"6271">
<li data-start=3D"6210" data-end=3D"6237" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6212" data-end=3D"6237" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"621=
2" data-end=3D"6225">bg-blue-500</code>: Fond bleu.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6238" data-end=3D"6271" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6240" data-end=3D"6271" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"624=
0" data-end=3D"6252">bg-red-300</code>: Fond rouge clair.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start=3D"6273" data-end=3D"6310" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6278" data-end=3D"6298">Couleur de texte</strong> (<code data-start=3D"6300=
" data-end=3D"6308">text-*</code>):</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"6311" data-end=3D"6376">
<li data-start=3D"6311" data-end=3D"6339" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6313" data-end=3D"6339" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"631=
3" data-end=3D"6325">text-white</code>: Texte blanc.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6340" data-end=3D"6376" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6342" data-end=3D"6376" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"634=
2" data-end=3D"6357">text-gray-800</code>: Texte gris fonc=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start=3D"6378" data-end=3D"6419" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6383" data-end=3D"6405">Couleur de bordure</strong> (<code data-start=3D"64=
07" data-end=3D"6417">border-*</code>):</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"6420" data-end=3D"6498">
<li data-start=3D"6420" data-end=3D"6455" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6422" data-end=3D"6455" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"642=
2" data-end=3D"6439">border-blue-500</code>: Bordure bleue.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6456" data-end=3D"6498" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6458" data-end=3D"6498" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"645=
8" data-end=3D"6475">border-gray-200</code>: Bordure grise claire.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start=3D"6500" data-end=3D"6538" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6505" data-end=3D"6524">Couleur d'ombre</strong> (<code data-start=3D"6526"=
 data-end=3D"6536">shadow-*</code>):</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"6539" data-end=3D"6597">
<li data-start=3D"6539" data-end=3D"6567" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6541" data-end=3D"6567" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"654=
1" data-end=3D"6552">shadow-lg</code>: Ombre grande.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6568" data-end=3D"6597" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6570" data-end=3D"6597" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"657=
0" data-end=3D"6581">shadow-md</code>: Ombre moyenne.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start=3D"6599" data-end=3D"6651" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6604" data-end=3D"6635">Couleur des survols (hover)</strong> (<code data-st=
art=3D"6637" data-end=3D"6649">hover:bg-*</code>):</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"6652" data-end=3D"6775">
<li data-start=3D"6652" data-end=3D"6712" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6654" data-end=3D"6712" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"665=
4" data-end=3D"6673">hover:bg-blue-700</code>: Changer la couleur de fond a=
u survol.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6713" data-end=3D"6775" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6715" data-end=3D"6775" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"671=
5" data-end=3D"6735">hover:text-red-500</code>: Changer la couleur du texte=
 au survol.</p>
</li>
</ul>
