<h3 data-start=3D"1451" data-end=3D"1504" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
1455" data-end=3D"1504">1. Introduction =C3=A0 l=E2=80=99opacit=C3=A9 dans =
Tailwind CSS</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"1506" data-end=3D"1889" class=3D"">L=E2=80=99opacit=C3=A9 =
d=C3=A9finit la transparence d=E2=80=99un =C3=A9l=C3=A9ment. Une opacit=C3=
=A9 de <code data-start=3D"1569" data-end=3D"1572">1</code> signifie que l'=
=C3=A9l=C3=A9ment est compl=C3=A8tement opaque, tandis qu'une opacit=C3=A9 =
de <code data-start=3D"1646" data-end=3D"1649">0</code> signifie qu=E2=80=
=99il est compl=C3=A8tement transparent. Les valeurs d'opacit=C3=A9 se situ=
ent g=C3=A9n=C3=A9ralement entre 0 et 1. Dans Tailwind CSS, les classes d=
=E2=80=99opacit=C3=A9 permettent de d=C3=A9finir facilement cette propri=C3=
=A9t=C3=A9 CSS sans avoir =C3=A0 =C3=A9crire de CSS personnalis=C3=A9.</p>
<p data-start=3D"1891" data-end=3D"2116" class=3D"">Tailwind offre des clas=
ses pr=C3=A9d=C3=A9finies pour manipuler l=E2=80=99opacit=C3=A9 d=E2=80=99u=
n =C3=A9l=C3=A9ment en utilisant un syst=C3=A8me de valeurs standardis=C3=
=A9es. Ces classes facilitent la cr=C3=A9ation d=E2=80=99effets visuels tou=
t en gardant un code HTML propre et rapide.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"2118" data-end=3D"2121" class=3D"">
<h3 data-start=3D"2123" data-end=3D"2159" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2127" data-end=3D"2159">2. Classes d=E2=80=99opacit=C3=A9 de base</strong><=
/h3>
<p data-start=3D"2161" data-end=3D"2342" class=3D"">Les classes d'opacit=C3=
=A9 de base dans Tailwind CSS suivent la syntaxe <code data-start=3D"2228" =
data-end=3D"2245">opacity-{value}</code>. La valeur est un nombre allant de=
 0 =C3=A0 100, repr=C3=A9sentant l'opacit=C3=A9 en pourcentage. Par exemple=
 :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2344" data-end=3D"2547">
<li data-start=3D"2344" data-end=3D"2399" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2346" data-end=3D"2399" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"234=
6" data-end=3D"2357">opacity-0</code>: Opacit=C3=A9 de 0% (compl=C3=A8temen=
t transparent)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2400" data-end=3D"2430" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2402" data-end=3D"2430" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"240=
2" data-end=3D"2414">opacity-25</code>: Opacit=C3=A9 de 25%</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2431" data-end=3D"2461" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2433" data-end=3D"2461" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"243=
3" data-end=3D"2445">opacity-50</code>: Opacit=C3=A9 de 50%</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2462" data-end=3D"2492" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2464" data-end=3D"2492" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"246=
4" data-end=3D"2476">opacity-75</code>: Opacit=C3=A9 de 75%</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2493" data-end=3D"2547" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2495" data-end=3D"2547" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"249=
