<h3 data-start=3D"3880" data-end=3D"3953" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3884" data-end=3D"3953">3. Classes de Tailwind CSS pour l'espacement des li=
gnes (Leading)</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"3955" data-end=3D"4197" class=3D"">L'<strong data-start=3D=
"3957" data-end=3D"3988">espacement entre les lignes</strong> (ou <strong d=
ata-start=3D"3993" data-end=3D"4004">leading</strong>) contr=C3=B4le l'espa=
ce vertical entre les lignes de texte dans un =C3=A9l=C3=A9ment. Un <strong=
 data-start=3D"4079" data-end=3D"4090">leading</strong> bien ajust=C3=A9 pe=
ut rendre le texte plus lisible, surtout dans les longs paragraphes ou les =
articles de blog.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"4199" data-end=3D"4240" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4204" data-end=3D"4238">Syntaxe des classes de leading</strong> :</h4>
<p data-start=3D"4242" data-end=3D"4389" class=3D"">Les classes de <strong =
data-start=3D"4257" data-end=3D"4268">leading</strong> dans Tailwind CSS su=
ivent la syntaxe suivante : <code data-start=3D"4317" data-end=3D"4333">lea=
ding-{size}</code>, o=C3=B9 <code data-start=3D"4338" data-end=3D"4346">{si=
ze}</code> correspond =C3=A0 une des valeurs disponibles :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4391" data-end=3D"4756">
<li data-start=3D"4391" data-end=3D"4442" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4393" data-end=3D"4442" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"439=
3" data-end=3D"4407">leading-none</code> : Espacement entre les lignes nul.=
</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4443" data-end=3D"4498" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4445" data-end=3D"4498" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"444=
5" data-end=3D"4460">leading-tight</code> : Espacement r=C3=A9duit entre le=
s lignes.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4499" data-end=3D"4564" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4501" data-end=3D"4564" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"450=
1" data-end=3D"4515">leading-snug</code> : Espacement l=C3=A9g=C3=A8rement =
r=C3=A9duit entre les lignes.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4565" data-end=3D"4634" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4567" data-end=3D"4634" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"456=
7" data-end=3D"4583">leading-normal</code> : Espacement normal entre les li=
gnes (par d=C3=A9faut).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4635" data-end=3D"4696" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4637" data-end=3D"4696" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"463=
7" data-end=3D"4654">leading-relaxed</code> : Espacement plus large entre l=
es lignes.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4697" data-end=3D"4756" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4699" data-end=3D"4756" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"469=
9" data-end=3D"4714">leading-loose</code> : Espacement tr=C3=A8s large entr=
e les lignes.</p>
</li>
</ul>
