<ul data-start=3D"6827" data-end=3D"7054">
<li data-start=3D"6827" data-end=3D"6884" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6829" data-end=3D"6884" class=3D"">Par d=C3=A9faut, le tex=
te est align=C3=A9 =C3=A0 gauche (<code data-start=3D"6871" data-end=3D"688=
2">text-left</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6885" data-end=3D"6962" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6887" data-end=3D"6962" class=3D"">Sur les =C3=A9crans moy=
ens (breakpoint <code data-start=3D"6921" data-end=3D"6925">md</code>), il =
sera centr=C3=A9 (<code data-start=3D"6944" data-end=3D"6960">md:text-cente=
r</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6963" data-end=3D"7054" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6965" data-end=3D"7054" class=3D"">Sur les =C3=A9crans lar=
ges (breakpoint <code data-start=3D"6999" data-end=3D"7003">lg</code>), le =
texte sera align=C3=A9 =C3=A0 droite (<code data-start=3D"7037" data-end=3D=
"7052">lg:text-right</code>).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"7056" data-end=3D"7149" class=3D"">Cela permet de cr=C3=A9=
er des designs adaptatifs qui changent en fonction de la taille de l'=C3=A9=
cran.</p>
