eurs d=C3=A9finie dans le fichier de configuration <code data-start=3D"3675=
" data-end=3D"3695">tailwind.config.js</code>.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"3698" data-end=3D"3738" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3703" data-end=3D"3738">Classes de couleur de bordure :</strong></h4>
<ul data-start=3D"3740" data-end=3D"4023">
<li data-start=3D"3740" data-end=3D"3888" class=3D"">
