63">border-red-300</code>, <code data-start=3D"3865" data-end=3D"3882">bord=
er-blue-600</code>, etc.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3889" data-end=3D"4023" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3891" data-end=3D"4023" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"389=
1" data-end=3D"3919">border-{color}-{intensity}</code> : Tailwind CSS utili=
