<p data-start=3D"2972" data-end=3D"3159" class=3D"">La classe <code data-st=
art=3D"2982" data-end=3D"2990">shadow</code> applique une ombre l=C3=A9g=C3=
=A8re autour de l'=C3=A9l=C3=A9ment. Vous pouvez augmenter l=E2=80=99intens=
it=C3=A9 de l=E2=80=99ombre en utilisant des variantes comme <code data-sta=
rt=3D"3116" data-end=3D"3127">shadow-sm</code>, <code data-start=3D"3129" d=
ata-end=3D"3140">shadow-md</code>, <code data-start=3D"3142" data-end=3D"31=
53">shadow-lg</code>, etc.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"3161" data-end=3D"3164" class=3D"">
<h3 data-start=3D"3166" data-end=3D"3213" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3170" data-end=3D"3213">3. Personnalisation des ombres de bo=C3=AEte</stron=
g></h3>
<p data-start=3D"3215" data-end=3D"3370" class=3D"">Tailwind CSS vous offre=
 plusieurs classes utilitaires pour personnaliser l=E2=80=99apparence des o=
mbres de bo=C3=AEte. Ces classes contr=C3=B4lent trois aspects principaux :=
</p>
<ol data-start=3D"3371" data-end=3D"3503">
<li data-start=3D"3371" data-end=3D"3413" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3374" data-end=3D"3413" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
374" data-end=3D"3389">L'intensit=C3=A9</strong> (la taille de l'ombre).</p=
>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3414" data-end=3D"3459" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3417" data-end=3D"3459" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
417" data-end=3D"3433">La direction</strong> (la position de l'ombre).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3460" data-end=3D"3503" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3463" data-end=3D"3503" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
463" data-end=3D"3476">La port=C3=A9e</strong> (la diffusion de l'ombre).</=
p>
</li>
</ol>
<h4 data-start=3D"3505" data-end=3D"3535" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3510" data-end=3D"3535">Contr=C3=B4ler l'intensit=C3=A9</strong></h4>
<p data-start=3D"3537" data-end=3D"3657" class=3D"">L'intensit=C3=A9 de l'o=
mbre est d=C3=A9termin=C3=A9e par la classe <code data-start=3D"3589" data-=
end=3D"3606">shadow-{niveau}</code>. Voici quelques classes pour les ombres=
