<li data-start=3D"3720" data-end=3D"3750" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3722" data-end=3D"3750" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"372=
2" data-end=3D"3733">shadow-md</code> : Ombre moyenne.</p>
