428" data-end=3D"2444"><code data-start=3D"2430" data-end=3D"2434">sm</code=
> (Small)</strong> : <code data-start=3D"2447" data-end=3D"2454">640px</cod=
e> et plus, g=C3=A9n=C3=A9ralement pour les petits appareils comme les t=C3=
=A9l=C3=A9phones en mode portrait.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2542" data-end=3D"2617" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2544" data-end=3D"2617" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
