> (Medium)</strong> : <code data-start=3D"2564" data-end=3D"2571">768px</co=
de> et plus, pour les tablettes en mode portrait.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2618" data-end=3D"2701" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2620" data-end=3D"2701" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
