<h3 data-start=3D"1969" data-end=3D"2022" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
1973" data-end=3D"2022">1. Qu'est-ce qu'une mise en page adaptative ?</stro=
ng></h3>
<p data-start=3D"2024" data-end=3D"2361" class=3D"">Une <strong data-start=
=3D"2028" data-end=3D"2055">mise en page adaptative</strong> (ou responsive=
 layout) fait r=C3=A9f=C3=A9rence =C3=A0 un design qui ajuste sa structure =
et ses =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments en fonction de la taille de l'=C3=A9cran ou de la=
 fen=C3=AAtre de l'utilisateur. L'objectif est de s'assurer que le contenu =
soit affich=C3=A9 correctement sur tous les appareils, des t=C3=A9l=C3=A9ph=
ones mobiles aux grands =C3=A9crans de bureau.</p>
<p data-start=3D"2363" data-end=3D"2416" class=3D"">Les <strong data-start=
=3D"2367" data-end=3D"2396">mises en page adaptatives</strong> utilisent so=
uvent :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2417" data-end=3D"2640">
<li data-start=3D"2417" data-end=3D"2530" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2419" data-end=3D"2530" class=3D"">Des <strong data-start=
=3D"2423" data-end=3D"2444">points de rupture</strong> (breakpoints) pour m=
odifier l'apparence de la page =C3=A0 des tailles sp=C3=A9cifiques d'=C3=A9=
cran.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2531" data-end=3D"2640" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2533" data-end=3D"2640" class=3D"">Des <strong data-start=
=3D"2537" data-end=3D"2557">unit=C3=A9s relatives</strong> comme les pource=
ntages, <code data-start=3D"2582" data-end=3D"2586">vw</code>, <code data-s=
tart=3D"2588" data-end=3D"2592">vh</code> et les rems pour rendre les =C3=
=A9l=C3=A9ments flexibles.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"2642" data-end=3D"2880" class=3D"">Dans <strong data-start=
=3D"2647" data-end=3D"2663">Tailwind CSS</strong>, cela est r=C3=A9alis=C3=
=A9 principalement gr=C3=A2ce =C3=A0 des classes utilitaires pour la dispos=
ition, les colonnes, les espacements et les tailles d'=C3=A9l=C3=A9ments, q=
ui sont conditionnellement appliqu=C3=A9es en fonction des points de ruptur=
e.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"2882" data-end=3D"2885" class=3D"">
<h3 data-start=3D"2887" data-end=3D"2959" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2891" data-end=3D"2959">2. Concepts cl=C3=A9s de la mise en page adaptative=
 avec Tailwind CSS</strong></h3>
<h4 data-start=3D"2961" data-end=3D"2982" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2966" data-end=3D"2982">Mobile-first</strong></h4>
<p data-start=3D"2984" data-end=3D"3241" class=3D"">La philosophie <strong =
data-start=3D"2999" data-end=3D"3015">mobile-first</strong> de Tailwind CSS=
 signifie que les styles par d=C3=A9faut sont appliqu=C3=A9s pour les petit=
s =C3=A9crans, et les styles conditionnels sont ajout=C3=A9s pour les =C3=
=A9crans plus grands en utilisant des points de rupture (comme <code data-s=
tart=3D"3217" data-end=3D"3221">sm</code>, <code data-start=3D"3223" data-e=
nd=3D"3227">md</code>, <code data-start=3D"3229" data-end=3D"3233">lg</code=
>, <code data-start=3D"3235" data-end=3D"3239">xl</code>).</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"3243" data-end=3D"3269" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3248" data-end=3D"3269">Grille et Flexbox</strong></h4>
<ul data-start=3D"3271" data-end=3D"3596">
<li data-start=3D"3271" data-end=3D"3483" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3273" data-end=3D"3483" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
273" data-end=3D"3290">Grille (Grid)</strong> : Tailwind utilise un syst=C3=
=A8me de grille tr=C3=A8s flexible qui permet de diviser la page en diff=C3=
=A9rentes colonnes et lignes, tout en permettant un contr=C3=B4le pr=C3=A9c=
is sur les tailles et les espacements.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3484" data-end=3D"3596" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3486" data-end=3D"3596" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
486" data-end=3D"3497">Flexbox</strong> : Utilis=C3=A9 pour des mises en pa=
ge dynamiques o=C3=B9 les =C3=A9l=C3=A9ments s'adaptent selon la taille de =
l'=C3=A9cran.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start=3D"3598" data-end=3D"3624" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3603" data-end=3D"3624">Points de rupture</strong></h4>
<p data-start=3D"3626" data-end=3D"3679" class=3D"">Les points de rupture p=
ar d=C3=A9faut dans Tailwind sont :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3680" data-end=3D"3789">
<li data-start=3D"3680" data-end=3D"3706" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3682" data-end=3D"3706" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
682" data-end=3D"3690"><code data-start=3D"3684" data-end=3D"3688">sm</code=
></strong> : 640px et plus</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3707" data-end=3D"3733" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3709" data-end=3D"3733" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
709" data-end=3D"3717"><code data-start=3D"3711" data-end=3D"3715">md</code=
></strong> : 768px et plus</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3734" data-end=3D"3761" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3736" data-end=3D"3761" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
736" data-end=3D"3744"><code data-start=3D"3738" data-end=3D"3742">lg</code=
></strong> : 1024px et plus</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3762" data-end=3D"3789" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3764" data-end=3D"3789" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
764" data-end=3D"3772"><code data-start=3D"3766" data-end=3D"3770">xl</code=
></strong> : 1280px et plus</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"3791" data-end=3D"3916" class=3D"">Les classes comme <code=
 data-start=3D"3809" data-end=3D"3825">sm:grid-cols-2</code> ou <code data-=
start=3D"3829" data-end=3D"3842">md:flex-row</code> permettent de sp=C3=A9c=
ifier des styles diff=C3=A9rents selon la taille de l'=C3=A9cran.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"3918" data-end=3D"3921" class=3D"">
<h3 data-start=3D"3923" data-end=3D"3971" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
