<p data-start=3D"3048" data-end=3D"3145" class=3D"">C'est =C3=A0 cet endroi=
t que vous allez apporter toutes les modifications pour personnaliser Tailw=
ind.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"3147" data-end=3D"3150" class=3D"">
<h3 data-start=3D"3152" data-end=3D"3192" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3156" data-end=3D"3192">2. Personnalisation des couleurs</strong></h3>
<h4 data-start=3D"3194" data-end=3D"3236" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3199" data-end=3D"3236">Couleurs de fond, texte, bordures</strong></h4>
<p data-start=3D"3238" data-end=3D"3580" class=3D"">Tailwind CSS fournit de=
