=A9finissent les diff=C3=A9rentes =C3=A9tapes d'une animation, y compris le=
s changements de style =C3=A0 chaque =C3=A9tape.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2219" data-end=3D"2367" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2221" data-end=3D"2367" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
