ri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s li=C3=A9es aux couleurs (<code data-start=3D"3138" data-en=
d=3D"3156">background-color</code>, <code data-start=3D"3158" data-end=3D"3=
165">color</code>, <code data-start=3D"3167" data-end=3D"3181">border-color=
</code>, etc.).</p>
