<p data-start=3D"2838" data-end=3D"2931" class=3D"">Exemple : <code data-st=
art=3D"2848" data-end=3D"2852">0%</code> repr=C3=A9sente le d=C3=A9but de l=
'animation, <code data-start=3D"2889" data-end=3D"2894">50%</code> est au m=
ilieu, et <code data-start=3D"2913" data-end=3D"2919">100%</code> est la fi=
n.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2933" data-end=3D"3547" class=3D"">
