053" data-end=3D"3073"><code data-start=3D"3055" data-end=3D"3071">animatio=
n-name</code></strong> : Le nom de l'animation (fait r=C3=A9f=C3=A9rence =
=C3=A0 la d=C3=A9claration <code data-start=3D"3131" data-end=3D"3143">@key=
frames</code>).</p>
